# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Generated Playwright pytest adapter using the `rigorpath_web_test` package from
the `rigor-test` runtime at `{{RUNTIME_REVISION}}`.

Install the pinned runtime and Chromium:

```bash
uv sync
uv run playwright install chromium
```

Collect generated testcases without contacting the application:

```bash
uv run pytest --collect-only -q
```

Execute only after setting the declared environment and satisfying its confirmation
policy:

```bash
WEBTEST_BASE_URL=https://web.example.test uv run pytest -q
```

Generate business testcases under `tests/` and reusable product Page/Component
Objects under `pages/`. Each runtime-managed Web testcase must declare a valid
`rigor_source` marker. Do not commit credentials or authenticated storage state.
